OL,3,ACOP31 climate talks fail to agree deal
OL,4,Aas EU and others reject draft over
OL,5,Afossil fuels row
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe COP31 climate talks in Turkey fail
OL,8,Fto agree a deal after the EU and others
OL,9,Frejected the final draft agreement -
OL,10,Fwe're bringing you the latest updates
OL,11,Fand analysis here
OL,13,FAn EU representative accuses some oil
OL,14,Fstates of hijacking talks, after the
OL,15,Ffourth draft deal still contained no
OL,16,Fmention of fossil fuels
OL,18,FRussia defended opposing the inclusion
OL,19,Fof a commitment to move away from
OL,20,Ffossil fuels, and was directly critical
OL,21,Fof the EU in its speech
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
