OL,3,ACOP31 climate talks fail to agree deal
OL,4,Aas EU and others reject draft over
OL,5,Afossil fuels row
OL,6,
OL,7,FAustralian minister Chris Bowen,
OL,8,FCOP31's president of negotiations, says
OL,9,Fthe summit faced the "most complicated
OL,10,Fand fraught geopolitical environment in
OL,11,Fliving memory"
OL,13,FUK Energy Secretary Miatta Fahnbulleh
OL,14,Fsays it is "disappointing" that the
OL,15,Ftalks did not manage to "build
OL,16,Fconsensus" between parties
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
