OL,3,ACOP31 climate talks fail to agree deal
OL,4,Aas EU and others reject draft over
OL,5,Afossil fuels row
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe draft acknowledges the goal set by
OL,8,Fthe 2015 Paris Agreement of keeping the
OL,9,Frise in global temperatures below 1.5C
OL,10,Fis going to be missed - as warming goes
OL,11,Fbeyond this the effects of climate
OL,12,Fchange will ramp up significantly
OL,14,FThe summit is the longest-running in
OL,15,Fhistory, with negotiations continuing
OL,16,Ftwo days after it had been due to end -
OL,17,Fhere's a timeline of how we got here
